@startuml
title Notification Flow — Account -> NotificationObservers
participant Account
participant NotificationObserver
participant EmailNotifier
participant SMSNotifier
participant InAppNotifier

Account -> NotificationObserver: notifyObservers(message)
activate NotificationObserver
NotificationObserver -> EmailNotifier: send(message)
NotificationObserver -> SMSNotifier: send(message)
NotificationObserver -> InAppNotifier: send(message)
EmailNotifier --> NotificationObserver: sent
SMSNotifier --> NotificationObserver: sent
InAppNotifier --> NotificationObserver: stored
deactivate NotificationObserver

@enduml